docs {
  # Batch Presigned Upload URLs (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/presigned-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Generates a list of temporary presigned PUT URLs enabling clients to upload multiple files directly and concurrently to RustFS / S3 storage.

  ## Request

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `items` | `array` | Yes | List of files to get presigned upload URLs for (1 to 50 items) |
  | `items[].filename` | `string` | Yes | File name |
  | `items[].type` | `string` | Yes | Attachment type |
  | `items[].file_size_bytes` | `int64` | Yes | File size |
  | `items[].mime_type` | `string` | Yes | MIME type |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "filename": "gallery_1.jpg",
          "upload_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/gallery_image/2026/11/abc1_gallery_1.jpg?...",
          "object_key": "attachments/gallery_image/2026/11/abc1_gallery_1.jpg",
          "expires_in_seconds": 900
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```
}
